{"id":"e213602dd9109075","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families.md","title":"Definition — Sieve Presheaf and Matching Families as Natural Transformations","display":"Definition — Sieve Presheaf and Matching Families as Natural Transformations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families","aliases":["14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families"],"display":"Definition — Sieve Presheaf and Matching Families as Natural Transformations","depends_on":["[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","[[14-df-sieve]]","[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Sieve Presheaf and Matching Families as Natural Transformations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"300365f146cacc8a\" href=\"?note=300365f146cacc8a\" title=\"14-df-presheaf-category\">14-df-presheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" href=\"?note=74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5\" title=\"14-df-sieve\">14-df-sieve</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b75f5f3e37180e81\" href=\"?note=b75f5f3e37180e81\" title=\"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf\">14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 上的筛，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为预层。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{\\flat}\">\\(S^{\\flat}\\)</span> 是下列预层；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}(P,Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}(P,Q)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\eta\\mid\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\eta,P,Q)\\}\">\\(\\{\\eta\\mid\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\eta,P,Q)\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:D\\to C\">\\(h:D\\to C\\)</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:E\\to D\">\\(g:E\\to D\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\circ g\">\\(h\\circ g\\)</span> 有定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\">\\(P,Q\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\)</span> 为自然变换集合构造的参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Nat}(P,Q)\\coloneqq\\{\\eta\\mid\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\eta,P,Q)\\},\\\\\nS^{\\flat}_0(D)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in S\\mid\\mathrm{dom}(h)=D\\},\\qquad\nS^{\\flat}_1(g)\\coloneqq\\bigl(S^{\\flat}_0(D),S^{\\flat}_0(E),(h\\mapsto h\\circ g)\\bigr),\\\\\nS^{\\flat}\\coloneqq(S^{\\flat}_0,S^{\\flat}_1),\\qquad\n\\iota_S\\coloneqq(S^{\\flat},y(C),(\\,(S^{\\flat}(D),\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C),(h\\mapsto h))\\,)_{D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}),\\\\\n\\Theta_{S,F}:\\mathrm{Nat}(S^{\\flat},F)\\to\\mathrm{Match}_F(S),\\qquad\n\\Theta_{S,F}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq(\\alpha_{\\mathrm{dom}(h)}(h))_{h\\in S},\\\\\n\\Theta_{S,F}^{-1}(x)\\coloneqq(S^{\\flat},F,((S^{\\flat}(D),F(D),(h\\mapsto x_h)))_{D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Nat}(P,Q)\\coloneqq\\{\\eta\\mid\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\eta,P,Q)\\},\\\\\nS^{\\flat}_0(D)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in S\\mid\\mathrm{dom}(h)=D\\},\\qquad\nS^{\\flat}_1(g)\\coloneqq\\bigl(S^{\\flat}_0(D),S^{\\flat}_0(E),(h\\mapsto h\\circ g)\\bigr),\\\\\nS^{\\flat}\\coloneqq(S^{\\flat}_0,S^{\\flat}_1),\\qquad\n\\iota_S\\coloneqq(S^{\\flat},y(C),(\\,(S^{\\flat}(D),\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C),(h\\mapsto h))\\,)_{D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}),\\\\\n\\Theta_{S,F}:\\mathrm{Nat}(S^{\\flat},F)\\to\\mathrm{Match}_F(S),\\qquad\n\\Theta_{S,F}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq(\\alpha_{\\mathrm{dom}(h)}(h))_{h\\in S},\\\\\n\\Theta_{S,F}^{-1}(x)\\coloneqq(S^{\\flat},F,((S^{\\flat}(D),F(D),(h\\mapsto x_h)))_{D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：II.2；III.4。筛封闭性保证前合成仍在筛中。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_S\">\\(\\iota_S\\)</span> 的每个分量是包含，因而自然且为单态射。自然性恰是相容族方程，故两种所写变换互逆；这把层条件写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}(yC,F)\\to\\mathrm{Nat}(S^{\\flat},F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}(yC,F)\\to\\mathrm{Nat}(S^{\\flat},F)\\)</span> 的双射，而不依赖外部筛原子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-presheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-presheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sieve","status":"resolved","id":"74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf","status":"resolved","id":"b75f5f3e37180e81","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-matching-families-separated-presheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"S^{\\flat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nat}(P,Q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\eta\\mid\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\eta,P,Q)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"h:D\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"g:E\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"h\\circ g","display":false},{"tex":"P,Q\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\widehat{\\mathcal C})","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{Nat}(P,Q)\\coloneqq\\{\\eta\\mid\\mathrm{IsNatural}(\\eta,P,Q)\\},\\\\\nS^{\\flat}_0(D)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in S\\mid\\mathrm{dom}(h)=D\\},\\qquad\nS^{\\flat}_1(g)\\coloneqq\\bigl(S^{\\flat}_0(D),S^{\\flat}_0(E),(h\\mapsto h\\circ g)\\bigr),\\\\\nS^{\\flat}\\coloneqq(S^{\\flat}_0,S^{\\flat}_1),\\qquad\n\\iota_S\\coloneqq(S^{\\flat},y(C),(\\,(S^{\\flat}(D),\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(D,C),(h\\mapsto h))\\,)_{D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}),\\\\\n\\Theta_{S,F}:\\mathrm{Nat}(S^{\\flat},F)\\to\\mathrm{Match}_F(S),\\qquad\n\\Theta_{S,F}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq(\\alpha_{\\mathrm{dom}(h)}(h))_{h\\in S},\\\\\n\\Theta_{S,F}^{-1}(x)\\coloneqq(S^{\\flat},F,((S^{\\flat}(D),F(D),(h\\mapsto x_h)))_{D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nat}(yC,F)\\to\\mathrm{Nat}(S^{\\flat},F)","display":false}],"bytes":2036,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families|Definition — Sieve Presheaf and Matching Families as Natural Transformations]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families]]"},{"id":"a56025295f88eafd","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Nat}$ 的带源靶自然变换集合使用 [[14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families]] 的正式定义；函子的求值按 [[14-df-category]] 解释。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-sieve-presheaves-and-matching-families|Definition — Sieve Presheaf and Matching Families as Natural Transformations]]"}],"outgoing":["99b72d10a7d872f5","300365f146cacc8a","74b7dc7dd3d7dcb5","b75f5f3e37180e81","1bdaf4a293143165"]}